00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.740
I'm trying to remember... Actually, you might not spawn with, like, a ton of gadgets all the time.

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:46.460
But it was for my health, for, like, the one-hit KO of it all.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:51.720
