00:48:52.280 --> 00:48:54.260
So, to me, I was just like, oh, there are some cool gadgets.

00:48:54.260 --> 00:49:00.040
And I did feel like I had a different use for, even though they are all projectiles.

00:49:00.380 --> 00:49:04.160
I did feel like, okay, I'm going to use the boomerang for this guy because I got some time.

00:49:04.480 --> 00:49:06.180
And, like, they're not as valuable.

00:49:06.180 --> 00:49:11.520
But I'm going to use the one, the spread shot for this one because, like, I really need to get a lot of the damage.

00:49:11.620 --> 00:49:14.960
So, like, it did feel like I was stopping and thinking, which gadget should I use?

00:49:15.100 --> 00:49:16.220
Like, that was a cool feeling.

00:49:16.300 --> 00:49:23.640
But, yeah, I could see other implementations, like, I mean, you know, it'd be cool to have, like, a bionic commando style, like, grappling hook or something.

00:49:23.640 --> 00:49:25.320
But, you know, obviously that would redesign the game.

00:49:25.420 --> 00:49:27.520
But, like, I could see other things that aren't just weapons.

00:49:27.760 --> 00:49:30.140
But the absence didn't bother me.

00:49:30.860 --> 00:49:34.520
Yeah, you could have a limited use grappling hook, too, though.

00:49:34.640 --> 00:49:40.500
Something where you have to, you know, like, plant it on one end and then plant it on the other in order to cross through or something like that.

00:49:40.520 --> 00:49:46.120
Or, you know, smoke bombs or something where, like, if you let off one of those, you can go through enemies.

00:49:46.560 --> 00:49:48.480
They don't work on bosses or something like that.

00:49:48.480 --> 00:49:58.660
But just thinking about more, like, practical uses for Batman's gadgets because that's really, like, at the end of the day, what makes Batman such a cool superhero is that he has no superpowers.

00:49:59.200 --> 00:50:04.620
Which is crazy because obviously he does if he's able to get the shit kicked out of him every single night and get back up in the morning.

00:50:04.620 --> 00:50:08.720
But he's not supposed to have any superpowers.

00:50:08.900 --> 00:50:15.260
So, really, it's his mind and these gadgets and his detective work that makes it, you know, who he is.

00:50:15.340 --> 00:50:21.720
And I feel like this game kind of focused more on the platforming to its advantage, right?

00:50:21.800 --> 00:50:25.960
We talked about how great that Batman jump feels and everything, adding a little extra weight to him.

00:50:25.960 --> 00:50:29.900
But it kind of sacrificed some of the other elements that Batman's known for.

00:50:30.100 --> 00:50:33.560
Now, if this, you know, wasn't a Batman game, would you judge it the same way?

00:50:33.980 --> 00:50:42.780
That's true. Like, so that's not necessarily fair to just put 100% of your vote into the fact that because they titled the game Batman and it's not using all of Batman's elements.

00:50:42.780 --> 00:50:47.480
Just like it's not all of Batman's known enemies just because they put different enemies in.

00:50:47.480 --> 00:50:49.060
You don't, like, take it off for that.

00:50:49.060 --> 00:50:49.960
I agree with that.

